    E'## Table of Contents\n\n- [Why Attend Affiliate Marketing Events?](#why-attend-affiliate-marketing-events)\n- [Q1 2026: Start the Year Strong](#q1-2026-start-the-year-strong)\n- [Q2 2026: Spring Into Action](#q2-2026-spring-into-action)\n- [Q3 2026: Fall Conferences](#q3-2026-fall-conferences)\n- [Q4 2026: Year-End Networking](#q4-2026-year-end-networking)\n- [How to Choose the Right Events](#how-to-choose-the-right-events)\n- [Conclusion](#conclusion)\n\n## Why Attend Affiliate Marketing Events?\n\nThe affiliate marketing industry thrives on relationships, knowledge sharing, and staying ahead of trends. In-person events offer unparalleled opportunities to connect with potential partners, learn from industry leaders, and discover new tools and strategies.\n\nWhether you''re an affiliate publisher, advertiser, network executive, or agency professional, attending the right conferences can significantly impact your business growth. With **over 50 affiliate marketing events** scheduled worldwide in 2026, choosing where to invest your time and budget is crucial.\n\nIn this guide, we''ll highlight the **must-attend events** for 2026, organized by quarter to help you plan your conference calendar effectively.\n\n## Q1 2026: Start the Year Strong\n\n### Affiliate Summit West (January 12-14, Las Vegas)\n\n**Affiliate Summit West** remains the flagship event for the affiliate marketing industry. Held at **Caesars Forum Las Vegas**, this three-day conference brings together over **7,000 attendees** from around the world.\n\n| Detail | Information |\n|--------|-------------|\n| **Dates** | January 12-14, 2026 |\n| **Location** | Caesars Forum, Las Vegas, NV |\n| **Expected Attendance** | 7,000+ |\n| **Ticket Price** | $800-2,000 |\n\nThe event features **seven topic tracks** covering:\n- Content & Commerce\n- Lead Generation\n- Brand Strategy\n- eCommerce\n- AI & Technology\n\n> **Pro Tip:** Book your hotel early—Vegas fills up fast during ASW. The venue is located through the LINQ promenade, under the High Roller Observation Wheel.\n\n![Affiliate Summit West conference hall](https://images.pexels.com/photos/2774556/pexels-photo-2774556.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1260&h=750)\n\n### iGB Affiliate Barcelona (January 20-21)\n\nFor those in the **iGaming affiliate space**, iGB Affiliate Barcelona is the premier event connecting affiliates, operators, and tech vendors. This focused gathering offers deep insights into the regulated gaming industry.\n\n### Affiliate World Dubai (March 4-5)\n\n**Affiliate World Dubai** has quickly become a major stop on the global affiliate circuit. With **7,000+ participants** expected, this event focuses on cutting-edge advertising methods.\n\n| Track | Focus Area |\n|-------|------------|\n| Meta Ads | Facebook & Instagram advertising |\n| Google Ads | Search and display marketing |\n| TikTok | Short-form video advertising |\n| AI-Powered Marketing | Automation and optimization |\n\n### TES Affiliate Conference (March 9-12, Marbella)\n\n**The European Summit (TES)** takes place at the Hard Rock Hotel Marbella, Spain. Running since 2009, TES attracts **2,000+ attendees** and offers a unique blend of business and networking in a stunning Mediterranean setting.\n\n### PI LIVE Level Up Bristol (March 26)\n\nThis new regional event from the PI LIVE team brings practical, peer-led learning directly to the UK affiliate community. Perfect for affiliate managers, partnership leads, and agency professionals who want focused education without the major conference price tag.\n\n![European affiliate marketing conference](https://images.pexels.com/photos/1181406/pexels-photo-1181406.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1260&h=750)\n\n## Q2 2026: Spring Into Action\n\n### Affiliate Summit East (July 27-28, New York)\n\n**Affiliate Summit East** returns to the **New York Marriott Marquis Times Square**. This mid-year event brings together **4,500+ professionals** including advertisers, publishers, ecommerce sellers, and tech suppliers.\n\n| Detail | Information |\n|--------|-------------|\n| **Dates** | July 27-28, 2026 |\n| **Location** | Marriott Marquis, Times Square, NYC |\n| **Expected Attendance** | 4,500+ |\n\nThe New York venue offers excellent networking opportunities with easy access to major brand headquarters and agency offices in the city.\n\n## Q3 2026: Fall Conferences\n\n### DMEXCO (September 23-24, Cologne)\n\n**DMEXCO** (Digital Marketing Exposition & Conference) is Europe''s largest digital marketing trade fair. Held at **Messe Cologne**, this event covers the full spectrum of digital marketing including:\n\n- Performance marketing\n- Affiliate marketing\n- Search engine marketing\n- Social media marketing\n- Mobile marketing\n- Email marketing\n\nWith **40,000+ visitors** and **700+ partner companies**, DMEXCO provides massive exposure to the European digital marketing ecosystem. It''s ideal for those looking to expand their affiliate programs into European markets.\n\n### PI LIVE Europe (October 19-21, London)\n\n**PI LIVE Europe** evolves into the "**Festival of Partnerships**" in 2026—a reimagined campus experience across Old Billingsgate, The Steel Yard, and additional venues in London.\n\nThis premier event brings together:\n- Leading advertisers and brands\n- Publishers and affiliates\n- Affiliate networks\n- Agencies and influencers\n\n> **Note:** PI LIVE USA has been paused for 2026, with resources focused on expanding the European event portfolio.\n\n![London affiliate marketing conference venue](https://images.pexels.com/photos/7647995/pexels-photo-7647995.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1260&h=750)\n\n## Q4 2026: Year-End Networking\n\n### Affiliate World Asia (December 9-10, Bangkok)\n\n**Affiliate World Asia** is the year-end finale for the affiliate marketing industry. Held at the **Centara Grand & Bangkok Convention Centre**, this event attracts:\n\n- **7,000+ attendees** from 110+ countries\n- **35+ world-class speakers**\n- **300+ exhibitors**\n- **210+ advertisers, traffic sources, and networks**\n\n| Detail | Information |\n|--------|-------------|\n| **Dates** | December 9-10, 2026 |\n| **Location** | Centara Grand, Bangkok |\n| **Expected Attendance** | 7,000+ |\n| **Content** | 20+ hours across two stages |\n\nBangkok offers excellent value with affordable accommodation and flights, making it an attractive destination for international attendees. The city''s vibrant nightlife and culture also provide memorable networking opportunities outside the conference halls.\n\n## How to Choose the Right Events\n\nWith limited time and budget, selecting the right events requires strategic thinking. Consider these factors:\n\n### By Your Role\n\n| Role | Recommended Events |\n|------|-------------------|\n| **Affiliate/Publisher** | Affiliate World events, Affiliate Summit |\n| **Advertiser/Brand** | PI LIVE, DMEXCO, Affiliate Summit |\n| **Network Executive** | All major events for relationship building |\n| **Agency Professional** | PI LIVE, DMEXCO, regional events |\n| **iGaming Focus** | iGB Affiliate Barcelona |\n\n### By Your Budget\n\n- **Premium ($1,500+):** Affiliate Summit West, Affiliate World events\n- **Mid-Range ($500-1,500):** PI LIVE, TES, DMEXCO\n- **Budget-Friendly ($200-500):** Regional events, PI LIVE Level Up\n\n### By Geography\n\n- **Americas Focus:** Affiliate Summit West & East\n- **Europe Focus:** PI LIVE Europe, DMEXCO, TES\n- **Asia-Pacific Focus:** Affiliate World Asia\n- **Global Coverage:** Affiliate World Dubai\n\n![Affiliate marketing professionals networking](https://images.pexels.com/photos/7869014/pexels-photo-7869014.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1260&h=750)\n\n## Conclusion\n\n2026 offers an exceptional lineup of affiliate marketing events around the world. From the massive gatherings at **Affiliate Summit** and **Affiliate World** to the focused learning at **PI LIVE** and regional events, there''s something for every professional in the performance marketing space.\n\n**Our top recommendations for 2026:**\n\n1. **Affiliate Summit West** (January) - The industry''s flagship event\n2. **Affiliate World Dubai** (March) - Cutting-edge advertising strategies\n3. **PI LIVE Europe** (October) - The Festival of Partnerships\n4. **Affiliate World Asia** (December) - Year-end networking in Bangkok\n\nStart planning now—the best hotels and early-bird tickets sell out months in advance. Mark your calendars, set your budgets, and prepare to make 2026 your most connected year yet.\n\n---\n\n**Ready to level up your affiliate marketing game?** Start by registering for at least one major event this year. The connections you make and strategies you learn will pay dividends for years to come.',
